WEBVTT

1
00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:11.490
Kim Ebert (Indicio): Greetings.

2
00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:15.590
Lynn Bendixsen (Indicio): Morning, Kim.

3
00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:17.240
Kim Ebert (Indicio): How are you today, Lynn?

4
00:01:18.810 --> 00:01:21.279
Lynn Bendixsen (Indicio): I'm doing excellent, how are you?

5
00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:23.999
Kim Ebert (Indicio): I'm doing pretty good.

6
00:01:34.270 --> 00:01:36.030
Kim Ebert (Indicio): Give me a sec here.

7
00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:38.210
Lynn Bendixsen (Indicio): It is raining here today.

8
00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:44.060
Lynn Bendixsen (Indicio): Nice.

9
00:01:45.490 --> 00:01:49.190
Lynn Bendixsen (Indicio): Strong drizzle acts like it's going to last all day.

10
00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:53.089
Kim Ebert (Indicio): That'd be nice.

11
00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:04.190
Lynn Bendixsen (Indicio): So good and bad. Some of the kids don't do well with rain, but… Anyway.

12
00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:08.509
Lynn Bendixsen (Indicio): Barometric pressure affects him.

13
00:02:09.380 --> 00:02:11.000
Lynn Bendixsen (Indicio): heavily sometimes.

14
00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:16.970
Kim Ebert (Indicio): Alrighty.

15
00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:30.059
Kim Ebert (Indicio): Welcome to the Indy Contributors Call for September 22nd, 2026.

16
00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:40.150
Kim Ebert (Indicio): Let's see here. We are managed by the Linux Foundation Antitrust Policy.

17
00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:47.010
Kim Ebert (Indicio): And the Linux Foundation Decentralized Trust Code of Conduct. If you have any questions, it's available on the wiki here.

18
00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:54.720
Kim Ebert (Indicio): We're still working on the.

19
00:02:55.210 --> 00:03:04.530
Kim Ebert (Indicio): Ubuntu 2204 upgrade. I'm still in the testing phase with the Indy node containers, working through some unit tests.

20
00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:08.150
Kim Ebert (Indicio): But, things are starting to look promising.

21
00:03:08.470 --> 00:03:11.580
Kim Ebert (Indicio): I'll keep you guys updated with my progress there.

22
00:03:11.910 --> 00:03:14.519
Kim Ebert (Indicio): Lynn, do you have anything to cover on your side?

23
00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:19.940
Lynn Bendixsen (Indicio): Nope, everything.

24
00:03:20.150 --> 00:03:23.359
Lynn Bendixsen (Indicio): Have as was talked about before, so I'm good.

25
00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:29.360
Kim Ebert (Indicio): Alrighty, we'll see everyone in 2 weeks, then.

26
00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:32.410
Lynn Bendixsen (Indicio): Thanks, Kim.

27
00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:33.530
Kim Ebert (Indicio): Yep.

